From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: OpenWrt <openwrt@nobody>
Date: Sun, 20 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] nvmem: layouts: include linux/hex.h for mac_pton and
 hex_to_bin

mac_pton() and hex_to_bin() are declared in linux/hex.h in this
kernel tree. Add the missing include to avoid implicit declaration
errors with -Werror=implicit-function-declaration.

Signed-off-by: OpenWrt <openwrt@nobody>
---
 drivers/nvmem/layouts.c | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

--- a/drivers/nvmem/layouts.c
+++ b/drivers/nvmem/layouts.c
@@ -10,6 +10,7 @@
 #include <linux/device.h>
 #include <linux/dma-mapping.h>
 #include <linux/etherdevice.h>
+#include <linux/hex.h>
 #include <linux/if_ether.h>
 #include <linux/nvmem-consumer.h>
 #include <linux/nvmem-provider.h>
